.TH ULAUNCHER "1" "September 2026" "Ulauncher 6.0.0-beta35" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
Ulauncher \- Feature rich application Launcher for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ulauncher
[\fI\,COMMAND\/\fR] [\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Ulauncher is a GTK application launcher with support for extensions, shortcuts
(scripts), calculator, file browser and custom themes.
.SH APP COMMANDS
.TP
start
Start the Ulauncher background process
.TP
show
Show the Ulauncher window (default command)
.TP
toggle
Toggle the Ulauncher window
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help
.SH EXTENSION & THEME COMMANDS
.TP
extensions (e)
List installed extensions
.TP
themes (t)
List installed themes
.TP
install (i)
Install an extension or a theme from URL
.TP
uninstall (rm)
Uninstall an extension or a theme
.TP
upgrade (up)
Upgrade extensions and themes
.TP
preview (pr)
Preview extension
